rs at load average 66 (burners reaped).","timestamp":1794491145715609792},{"author":"Rebar Bot","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","body":"HANDOFF STATE 2026-11-12 06:00 PST: in_progress. Fix MERGED (3370, 2102dcfb220); ACs ticked; evidence above. Blocked on closing: the plan re-review (needed after the AC edit) came back INDETERMINATE because Bedrock InvokeModel is explicitly denied by the BedrockDailySpendCapDeny policy (the daily spend cap tripped about 05:40 PST and releases at 00:00 UTC = 16:00 PST). Next: after the release, review_plan_start, then transition closed with ref=2102dcfb2205b6658fb0067c3d0fffc33e0bbbb2, class preexisting.","timestamp":1794491809280594073}],"completion_expectation":"required","created_at":1793826293606911001,"creation_channel":"cli","deps":[{"link_uuid":"9be804e1-5315-468c-86a7-5e00615641ad","relation":"discovered_from","target_id":"cded-334b-a742-4082"},{"link_uuid":"4f5fdd68-c5d7-47dc-8d66-c2e9b454fcb8","relation":"relates_to","target_id":"ab95-0caf-dc4b-4ce6"},{"link_uuid":"403dde21-6b87-4d7e-bc39-82c2dc3863b2","relation":"relates_to","target_id":"59a7-cb88-f2f9-4148"},{"link_uuid":"bcc7ccb9-dbc9-42d3-adfb-12b0ba220dd6","provenance":"derived","relation":"caused_by","target_id":"c605-488f-123a-4b05"}],"description":"## Context / Problem\n\n`tests/unit/test_snapshot_submodules_watchdog_c605.py::test_build_with_timed_out_listing_writes_no_sidecar` failed in a local `make verify` on 2026-11-04 (macOS, py3.12, load average about 44) with `SnapshotError: git ls-tree ... timed out after 1s`, raised from the test's SECOND `materialize` call. That call is meant to succeed: the slow `ls-tree` wrapper is already switched off (`slow_ls_tree(False)`), but the `slow_ls_tree` fixture also monkeypatches `git_fetch._GIT_TIMEOUT` to `_BOUND_S` (1 second) for the whole test, so the real `git ls-tree` on the recovery path has a 1-second budget. A loaded host exceeds it. The module passed 3 of 3 standalone runs right after, at the same load, and passed in all 3 CI Python cells for Gerrit 3309 patch set 1.\n\nDiscovered while verifying bald-diagnostic-cricket, whose change (src/rebar/_logging.py) does not touch snapshots; the module passes 3 of 3 with and without that change.\n\n## Acceptance Criteria\n\n- [x] The recovery `materialize` call in the test runs with a git bound that does not depend on host load, and the slow-path assertions still use the 1-second bound.\n- [x] The module passes under synthetic CPU load that previously reproduced the failure.","env_id":"492a5c71-6cda-48a6-8134-02ff6a672739","file_impact":[{"path":"tests/unit/test_snapshot_submodules_watchdog_c605.py","reason":"scope the 1 s bound to the slow call; load reproduction"}],"file_impact_scope":"paths","keyring":[],"last_status_env_id":"492a5c71-6cda-48a6-8134-02ff6a672739","managed_refs":[["relates_to","59a7-cb88-f2f9-4148"],["relates_to","ab95-0caf-dc4b-4ce6"]],"no_file_impact_reason":"","parent_id":null,"parent_status_uuid":"968c2fbb-ec14-4c4b-8bfe-05bb17c771a8","plan_review_phase":"execution","preconditions_summary":{"status":"pre-manifest"},"priority":2,"releases":[],"repos":[],"reverts":[],"status":"closed","tags":[],"ticket_id":"5e68-eb05-64d9-4720","ticket_type":"bug","title":"Snapshot watchdog test caps real git at 1s and fails under host load","verify_commands":[]},"source_event_uuids":["a7a82f29-f04d-4a05-bff2-9fcdcdd30140","8f94bab2-da40-4c5c-89f7-15397cb41d93","2ca111bb-ef48-471e-9170-c01c70cc9d61","4f5fdd68-c5d7-47dc-8d66-c2e9b454fcb8","07c4119b-1d64-4ffd-87db-6078a1d37db8","bc4d8bc9-a260-4119-a0c9-49c91f2f2cc9","403dde21-6b87-4d7e-bc39-82c2dc3863b2","1d68ec3c-503d-40ca-9298-5e42a792b34b","c653dd28-c476-4794-b452-a3a0553f463e","968c2fbb-ec14-4c4b-8bfe-05bb17c771a8","e4ecabd9-23c5-4534-9bf4-0e7cdc69c885","bcc7ccb9-dbc9-42d3-adfb-12b0ba220dd6"]},"env_id":"","event_type":"SNAPSHOT","timestamp":1794506725870229002,"uuid":"6cfabff5-0fd9-487a-b4a7-18ac86b7207e"}